# PAWRA Design Lock

Before designing or styling anything, follow `/DESIGN_LOCK.md` and `/hydrogen-quickstart/app/assets/tokens/design-lock.json`.

**Palette:** Forest `#2C4A3E` · Chestnut `#8B5A3C` · Golden Honey `#E8A538` · Ivory `#FDFBF7` · Near Black `#1E1E1E`  
**Dark:** `#111514` / `#1E2422` · Forest Pop `#4A7C65` · same gold · borders instead of shadows  
**Type:** Playfair Display (serif display) · Inter (sans UI) · JetBrains Mono  
**Hero:** full-bleed; brand + one headline + one support + CTAs only  
**Do not invent** new brand colors, neon jade, champagne, coral reds, purple gradients, or pure black.
